+- **Cons:** our serving is API-mediated (Render + vendor APIs); the bottleneck today is
+  quota and cost, not disk bandwidth — premature optimization for us.
+- **Risks:** infrastructure ideas adopted from papers without our own profiling = ghost
+  engineering effort.
+- **Anti-patterns flagged:** paper-driven infra rewrites without a measured bottleneck.
+- **এটা করা যাবে না:** no serving-layer rewrite motivated by a paper until our own
+  profiling shows the same bottleneck.
+- **SupremeAI adoption path:** quarantine_eval — revisit only if Qdrant/Redis profiling
+  (redis_stats, qdrant latency) shows I/O saturation at cadence scale.
